              "name": "Acurlytops"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used Rice Krispies for this, and they turned out great! It was so much easier than using the corn syrup version I've seen other places. I also melted 1 cup of chocolate chips for 'icing'. I would probably use 1.5 cups next time. Very quick, easy, and delicious!"
