              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "missiemac"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had some stale Maple Cheerios, so saw this recipe. It turned out yummy. I tweaked it though. Only added 1/4 c. of PB, and added chopped honey roasted peanuts. It tasted similar to Brach’s Maple Nut Goodies!",
