            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mickey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yummy cross between two traditional favorites. A little more flavor than Rice Krispie bars, but peanut butter flavoring is not as overpowering as Special K bars. Can substitute corn flake style cereal for the oat cereal. Kids love a cup or two of m&amp;m's tossed in for a little chocolate flavor and some added color.",
